BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:acc-graduate-fellowship-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T163759Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:Deadline: Asian Cultural Council Graduate Fellowship 2027 (USD 15\,
 000)
DESCRIPTION:The Asian Cultural Council's Graduate Fellowship supports Asian
  graduate students in an eligible arts or culture discipline at a US unive
 rsity. SUPPORT: USD 15\,000 for one academic year of full-time coursework\
 ; a second year may be renewed at ACC's discretion.\n\nOrganisation: Asian
  Cultural Council\nLocation: Full-time\, in-residence graduate programme i
 n the US. For citizens and permanent residents of ACC-eligible Asian count
 ries (US citizens and permanent residents not eligible).\nAward: USD 15\,0
 00 for one academic year\, renewable for a second year at ACC's discretion
 . No application fee.\nDuration: One academic year of full-time coursework
  (Fall 2027 to Spring 2028\, or Spring 2028 to Fall 2028)\n\nMore: https:/
 /www.asianculturalcouncil.org/grant-opportunities?utm_source=artificialnou
